            "effect": {
              "kind": "UnsupportedContinuous",
              "reason": "Nothing in the vocabulary describes an ability that functions from the opening hand before the game begins (CR 103.6): there is no condition for \u0027in your opening hand\u0027 or \u0027you\u0027re not the starting player\u0027, and no effect that begins the game with a permanent on the battlefield.",
              "text": "If this card is in your opening hand and you\u0027re not the starting player, you may begin the game with Gemstone Caverns on the battlefield with a luck counter on it. If you do, exile a card from your hand."
            },
            "where": "Hand",
            "characteristicDefining": false,
            "text": "If this card is in your opening hand and you\u0027re not the starting player, you may begin the game with Gemstone Caverns on the battlefield with a luck counter on it. If you do, exile a card from your hand."
